Name: Christopher Feener

File: auto_vampire.py

Description: 
  Runs automated tests in current folder by 
  iterating through combinations of system, example, 
  and option (for a total of 240 tests in example 
  categories 1-3)

Usage: 
  BEFORE YOU BEGIN: 
    Make sure to have vampire installed 
    and included in path environment variables!
  For a quick test run: 
    Run "python auto_vampire.py --dry-run" for a quick 
    check of all files that will be produced. 
  Complete run: 
    Run "python auto_vampire.py" for complete run 
    (this will take a potentially long time.)
    Results will be in the "results" folder 
